    ["<DecH>工艺：</>做旧皮革・银钉链饰・朋克街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Distressed Leather - Silver Stud Chain - Punk Streetwear\nToo proud to explain and with no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>珍珠华饰\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<P_Heart>（小棉袄！女儿绝对是老父亲的小棉袄！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Daddy's little girl! A daughter is definitely a father's little angel!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>不，在现实世界我有很多身份，你如果想找我，可以去鲁恩慈善基金会。至于心理治疗，这是“观众”途径的非凡能力。"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiles)</> No, I have many identities in the real world. If you want to find me, you can go to the Loen Charity Fund. As for psychotherapy, that is an Extraordinary ability of the 'Spectator' pathway.",
    ["<P_Heart>（没有灵性波动，不是污染……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No spiritual fluctuations, this isn't contamination...)</>",
    ["<Title>巨龙现身</>\n巨龙·投影于每周五、周日晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，现身<Highlight>猎龙城王城中心</>。若20:00前未被击退，巨龙将离开，且不触发击杀结算。\n\n<Title>归属伤害</>\n仅在巨龙周围<Highlight>40米</>内存活并对其造成伤害时，伤害才会计入玩家当前所在团队。巨龙被击退时，<Highlight>当前有效归属伤害最高的团队</>获得最终归属及拍卖奖励。靠近巨龙后，可实时查看当前归属伤害。\n\n<Title>伤害衰减</>\n玩家死亡、离开巨龙讨伐范围、切换分线或离开团队后，该玩家已为团队累计的归属伤害将开始衰减，并同步影响团队当前的有效归属伤害。\n\n触发衰减后的<Highlight>前5秒</>，归属伤害保持不变；从第6秒开始，<Highlight>每6秒减少原累计归属伤害的5%</>，持续120秒后归零。\n\n重新进入<Highlight>巨龙讨伐范围</>并恢复参战后，衰减停止。当前剩余的归属伤害将被保留，并在此基础上继续累计新造成的伤害。\n\n<Title>拍卖奖励</>\n击退巨龙后，将根据激战值开启对应档位的拍卖。<Highlight>激战值越高，可开启的拍卖奖励档位越高</>。\n\n<Title>资格限制</>\n每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。"] = "<Title>Dragon Appearance</>\nThe Dragon - Projection appears at the <Highlight>center of the Dragon Hunting City Royal City</> <Highlight>10 minutes after</> the start of the Hunting Time on Friday and Sunday nights, which is <Highlight>19:10</>. If it is not repelled before 20:00, the dragon will leave, and no kill settlement will be triggered. \n\n<Title>Ownership Damage</>\nDamage is only counted toward the player's current team if they are alive and dealing damage within <Highlight>40 meters</> of the dragon. When the dragon is repelled, the <Highlight>team with the highest current effective ownership damage</> receives the final ownership and auction rewards. You can view the current ownership damage in real-time after approaching the dragon. \n\n<Title>Damage Decay</>\nAfter a player dies, leaves the dragon crusade range, switches channels, or leaves the team, the ownership damage that player has accumulated for the team will begin to decay, which will simultaneously affect the team's current effective ownership damage. \n\nFor the <Highlight>first 5 seconds</> after decay is triggered, the ownership damage remains unchanged. Starting from the 6th second, it <Highlight>decreases by 5% of the original accumulated ownership damage every 6 seconds</>, reaching zero after 120 seconds. \n\nIf you re-enter the <Highlight>Dragon Crusade Range</> and resume combat, the decay will stop. The remaining ownership damage will be preserved, and new damage dealt will continue to accumulate on top of this base. \n\n<Title>Auction Rewards</>\nAfter repelling the dragon, auctions for corresponding tiers will be opened based on the Intense Battle Value. <Highlight>The higher the Intense Battle Value, the higher the tier of auction rewards that can be unlocked</>. \n\n<Title>Qualification Restrictions</>\nIn each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain at most <Highlight>1</> qualification for the Dragon - Projection final hunt auction; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during the same event.",
